## What to Do If a Nail Breaks at Prom

No competitor covers this. Know it before you need it.

**Broken acrylic:** A cracked acrylic can be temporarily stabilised with nail glue. Press the broken piece back into place, hold for 30 seconds, and it will last the evening. If the break is near the nail bed, file the rough edge and seal with clear topcoat. A small travel nail glue in your clutch covers every nail disaster.

**Lifted press-on:** A drop of nail glue under the lifted section and firm pressure for 30 seconds re-bonds it. Do not peel or force it off, as you will damage the natural nail surface underneath.

**Chipped gel:** One coat of clear topcoat over the chip smooths the surface and stops it spreading. Invisible in photos.

The emergency kit for your clutch: one small nail glue, one mini clear topcoat, one nail file. Three items that cover every nail type's worst-case scenario.

